{
  "out_dir": "apps/web/public/docs/understanding-results",
  "_hints": "The result screen is NOT a URL: it appears only on /risk-assessment right after pressing 'See my results', and History has no detail view, so every shot must fill the 6-step form and submit (each shot = one new saved assessment for patient1; 4 in total). Answers were chosen by running apps/api/services/screening.assess locally: shots top/why/bottom use age 45, Male, 170 cm, 90 kg, high BP yes, cholesterol yes, difficulty walking yes, smoker no, activity/fruit/veg yes, alcohol no, general health Fair (nth=3), 2 and 3 unwell days, no symptoms -> diabetes High, heart High, stroke NOT CONFIDENT, next step 'not confident'. Shot care uses age 55 + smoker yes -> all three High, next step 'See a doctor soon', which shows the 'Book a demo Endocrinology ... doctor' box. The form may be pre-filled from patient1's saved profile; the fill/click steps overwrite every answer. Radio inputs have name '<field>-<reactId>' (options order: Yes,No / Female,Male,Prefer not / Excellent..Poor). Number inputs per step in order: step1 age,height,weight; step4 mental days, physical days. The 'A clinician will review this result.' note (top mark 3) only shows if patient1 has both store_history and share_with_clinician consent; if it is absent drop that mark and tell the writer. The AppShell <main> scrolls internally; tall viewports are used so all marks fit at once. If the 'How sure' miss-rate lines are still loading, add a wait. If the bottom shot cannot fit What-if + guidance + buttons in one viewport, raise height.",
  "shots": [
    {
      "name": "top",
      "_note": "creates data: submits one risk assessment as patient1 (saved to history; goes to clinician review queue if patient1 shares with clinicians)",
      "account": "patient1@vitalnex.demo",
      "path": "/risk-assessment",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 1250,
      "steps": [
        {
          "wait_for": "input[type=number]"
        },
        {
          "fill": [
            "input[type=number] >> nth=0",
            "45"
          ]
        },
        {
          "click": "input[name^='sex-'] >> nth=1"
        },
        {
          "fill": [
            "input[type=number] >> nth=1",
            "170"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fill": [
            "input[type=number] >> nth=2",
            "90"
          ]
        },
        {
          "click": "button:has-text('Next')"
        },
        {
          "wait_for": "input[name^='high_bp-']"
        },
        {
          "click": "input[name^='high_bp-'] >> nth=0"
        },
        {
          "click": "input[name^='high_chol-'] >> nth=0"
        },
        {
          "click": "input[name^='diff_walk-'] >> nth=0"
        },
        {
          "click": "button:has-text('Next')"
        },
        {
          "wait_for": "input[name^='smoker-']"
        },
        {
          "click": "input[name^='smoker-'] >> nth=1"
        },
        {
          "click": "input[name^='phys_activity-'] >> nth=0"
        },
        {
          "click": "input[name^='fruits-'] >> nth=0"
        },
        {
          "click": "input[name^='veggies-'] >> nth=0"
        },
        {
          "click": "input[name^='heavy_alcohol-'] >> nth=1"
        },
        {
          "click": "button:has-text('Next')"
        },
        {
          "wait_for": "input[name^='gen_health-']"
        },
        {
          "click": "input[name^='gen_health-'] >> nth=3"
        },
        {
          "fill": [
            "input[type=number] >> nth=0",
            "2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fill": [
            "input[type=number] >> nth=1",
            "3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "click": "button:has-text('Next')"
        },
        {
          "wait_for": "text=Chest pain or pressure now"
        },
        {
          "click": "button:has-text('Next')"
        },
        {
          "wait_for": "button:has-text('See my results')"
        },
        {
          "click": "button:has-text('See my results')"
        },
        {
          "wait_for": "section[aria-labelledby='next-step-title']"
        },
        {
          "wait": 2500
        },
        {
          "scroll_to": "h2:text-is('Your screening results')"
        }
      ],
      "marks": [
        {
          "selector": "h2:text-is('Your screening results')",
          "n": 1
        },
        {
          "selector": "section[aria-labelledby='next-step-title']",
          "n": 2
        },
        {
          "selector": "p:has-text('A clinician will review this result.')",
          "n": 3
        },
        {
          "selector": "section[aria-label='Your screening results'] > div:nth-child(1)",
          "n": 4
        },
        {
          "selector": "section[aria-label='Your screening results'] > div:nth-child(3)",
          "n": 5
        }
      ]
    },
